# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and point these at your own checkouts to run the
# tests that are gated on external, copyrighted fixtures. Any test that needs
# one of these and does not find it prints SKIP and passes rather than
# failing -- these are optional, not part of what CI runs.

# Directory holding Mixamo/Samba Dancing/morph_test FBX fixtures. Individual
# files can be pointed at separately (MIXAMO_FBX, SAMBA_FBX, MORPH_FBX) if
# they are not all under one directory.
# FBX_FIXTURES=/path/to/fbx/fixtures
# MIXAMO_FBX=/path/to/mixamo.fbx
# SAMBA_FBX=/path/to/Samba Dancing.fbx
# MORPH_FBX=/path/to/morph_test.fbx

# Blender executable, for the suites that use it as an external oracle. Only
# needed if it is somewhere unusual: they look on PATH first, then under the
# Windows install root, and skip themselves if they find nothing.
# BLENDER=/path/to/blender

# Directory holding Binomial's reference Basis Universal transcoder
# (basis_transcoder.js/.wasm), as shipped in a three.js checkout under
# examples/jsm/libs/basis. Ground truth for the KTX2 differential tests.
# THREEJS_BASIS_DIR=/path/to/three.js/examples/jsm/libs/basis
